WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
You should bear the consequences if you behave inappropriately. What does that have to do with me?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,340
It's you, it's for you, it's my wish

3
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:12,840
In the past, he took me through all my life, and he never treated me so coldly.

4
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:15,840
Ever since you married into the Hou family, you have been good at dealing with narrow-mindedness.

5
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:25,470
Dealing with the occupying cousin of the crown prince, you have to take a look at me

6
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:33,830
Husband, you really like him, have you seen it?

7
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:40,160
It’s impossible, it’s possible. It’s the first time that the prince’s cousin met me.

8
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:41,860
You took the initiative to care about me

9
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:44,060
There are a lot of cousins coming to the Hou Mansion to beat Qiu Feng

10
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:46,060
How can I remember who is who?

11
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:48,260
Being troubled day by day and restless

12
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:51,260
When I see someone, I will ask you to find someone else. Don’t bother me.
